1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:03,700
Saalon school bus mein gaye, par yeh kabhi laal kyun nahi hoti?

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:06,970
Iska faisla 1939 ki ek meeting mein hua.

3
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:11,240
America mein Frank Cyr naam ke ek education expert ne meeting bulayi.

4
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:13,950
Kai rang dekhe gaye, aur jeeta peela.

5
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:17,500
Kyun? Peela rang aankh ke kone se bhi turant dikh jaata hai.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,380
Aap seedha na dekho, phir bhi bus nazar aa jaati hai.

7
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:23,930
Kohra ho ya shaam ki halki roshni, peela chamakta hai.

8
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:26,300
Aur kaale akshar door se padh lete ho.

9
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:29,550
Matlab yeh rang style nahi, bachon ki safety hai.

10
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:34,100
Aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko subscribe karo!
